# web/dist/ is intentionally NOT excluded — styles.css is committed and must be
# present in the image. See Dockerfile guard that validates this at build time.

# Runtime STATE — written live and persisted on a volume (AEGIS_STATE_DIR).
# NEVER bake these into the image: a stale local copy would overwrite the
# production track record on every deploy (the "records deleted on deploy" bug).
# Config artifacts the model LOADS (data/token_params, data/regime_stats,
# data/meta_gate_profiles, data/oi_cache) are intentionally KEPT — only these
# live-written state files are excluded.
data/track_record.json
data/alpha_track_record.json
data/perf_state.json
data/drift_state.json
data/scalp_trades.json
data/trader_track_record.json
data/trader_signals_state.json
web/track_record.json
web/trader_track_record.json
